## 1. Executive Audit & Architectural Foundations

### 1.1 Existing Navigation & Sidebar Model
- `apps/web/src/lib/admin/navigation.tsx` defines `NavItem` with `collapsible?: boolean` and `children?: NavItem[]`.
- `apps/web/src/components/admin/admin-shell.tsx` contains `CollapsibleNavParentItem`, which implements:
  - Accessible toggle button with chevron rotation (`ChevronDown` rotates `-90deg` when collapsed).
  - Auto-expansion when any child route is active (`isActiveRoute(child.href, pathname)`).
  - Manual toggle state preservation (`setManualExpanded(!expanded)`).
  - Keyboard accessibility with `aria-expanded` and `aria-controls`.
  - Responsive mobile drawer handling (`onNavigateMobile`).
  - Collapsed rail mode support with tooltips and screen-reader labels.
- **Audit Findings:** The existing `STUDY_GROUP` has a single item (`/admin/study-guides`). To satisfy the specification:
  - `admin-study-guides` must become a collapsible parent item.
  - Its children must be:
    1. **Notes**: `/admin/study-guides/notes`
    2. **Flashcards**: `/admin/study-guides/flashcards`
    3. **Review Sessions**: `/admin/study-guides/review-sessions`
    4. **Topic Quizzes**: `/admin/study-guides/topic-quizzes`

### 1.2 Domain Entities & Schema Inspection
- **Notes:** `StudyNote` model currently supports learner notes. Need publication workflow columns: `Status` (`Draft`, `PendingReview`, `Approved`, `Published`, `Archived`), `IsOfficial` (bool), and `StudyGuideId` (link to curated guides).
- **Flashcards:** `FlashcardDeck` and `Flashcard` currently support learner decks. Need `IsPublished` and `IsOfficial` flags on `FlashcardDeck` so administrative decks can be authored, published to all learners, and separated by RN/PN.
- **Review Sessions:** `StudyReviewSession` and `StudyReviewSessionItem` already persist full session tracking (duration, accuracy, recall distribution, mode, programme). Need an administrative configuration model `StudyReviewConfiguration` for global session limits and defaults, plus aggregate analytics queries.
- **Topic Quizzes:** `TopicQuizConfiguration`, `TopicQuizAttempt`, `TopicQuizResponse` exist. Need `Status`, `IsPublished`, `IsOfficial`, `Description`, `QuestionIdsJson`, `FeedbackMode`, and `MaxAttempts` to author and govern administrative quizzes sourcing canonical questions from `Questions`.
- **RBAC:** Roles in `authz.ts` and backend `RequireAdmin` policy. Administrative study guide operations will be authorized for `superadmin`, `admin`, `content_manager`, and `exam_manager`.

